        <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:lang="lzh" xml:space="preserve">
<ab>
<lb n="01"/><supplied reason="lost">經主 道門</supplied>
<lb n="01"/>
<lb n="T13n0397_0050b15"/>能調<supplied reason="lost">心 者，名之為施。</supplied>
<lb n="02"/>身心<supplied reason="lost">清涼，名之為戒</supplied>。
<lb n="03"/>諸法<supplied reason="lost">無常，名之為忍</supplied>。
<lb n="04"/>勤<supplied reason="lost">修是智，名為精進</supplied>。
<lb n="05"/>内<supplied reason="lost">外清淨，名為三昧</supplied>。
<lb n="06"/>觀<supplied reason="lost">真實故，名為智慧</supplied>。
</ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus"/>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
                <p>He can harmonize his mind; this is named Generosity. He keeps body and mind clear and cool; this is named Discipline. He sees that all entities are impermanent; this is named Patience. He diligently cultivates this knowledge; this is named Vigorous Effort. He sees that inner and outer are clear and pure; this is named Samadhi. He contemplates true reality; this is named Wisdom.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
